FROM --platform=$BUILDPLATFORM golang:1.26.7-alpine3.23@sha256:b17af760035fc2f338eed92d448a6c67f2d45438844fc6c60678fa5f99e44b57 AS build
WORKDIR /src
COPY go.mod go.sum ./
RUN go mod download
COPY . .
ARG VERSION=dev
ARG TARGETOS
ARG TARGETARCH
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=$TARGETOS GOARCH=$TARGETARCH go build -trimpath -ldflags="-s -w -X main.version=${VERSION}" -o /out/tailbridge-edge ./cmd/tailbridge-edge

FROM tailscale/tailscale:v1.102.4@sha256:2667499ed87ae29218f292556ba062918402dd5e92e93637af14867e4df12dd3
RUN apk add --no-cache iproute2 nftables
COPY --from=build /out/tailbridge-edge /usr/local/bin/tailbridge-edge
ENTRYPOINT ["/usr/local/bin/tailbridge-edge"]
